q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (SQL Practical No. 1 - Demonstrate GROUP BY and)Tj T* (ORDER BY)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Demonstrate the use of GROUP BY and ORDER BY clause.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE SAMPLE TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Department VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om','IT',50000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul','HR',30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(3,'Sneha','IT',60000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(4,'Amit','Finance',40000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(5,'Neha','HR',35000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (1 row inserted.)Tj T* (Commit complete.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: GROUP BY CLAUSE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (Find total salary department-wise:)Tj T* T* (SELECT Department, SUM\(Salary\) AS Total_Salary)Tj T* (FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (GROUP BY Department;)Tj T* T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Department | Total_Salary)Tj T* (IT         | 110000)Tj T* (HR         | 65000)Tj T* (Finance    | 40000)Tj T* T* (Explanation:)Tj T* (GROUP BY groups rows with same Department and calculates total salary.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 4: ORDER BY CLAUSE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (Display employees ordered by salary \(descending\):)Tj T* T* (SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (ORDER BY Salary DESC;)Tj T* T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Emp_id | Emp_name | Department | Salary)Tj T* (3      | Sneha    | IT         | 60000)Tj T* (1      | Om       | IT         | 50000)Tj T* (4      | Amit     | Finance    | 40000)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F12feeeed8-cfb6-4cdf-8022-dc3ee5376428 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
