q q 1 0 0 1 78 350.2898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 405.6 Tm (SELECT D.*)Tj T* (FROM DOCTOR D)Tj T* (JOIN PATIENTMASTER P ON D.Did = P.Pid)Tj T* (JOIN ADMITTEDPATIENT A ON P.Pcode = A.Pcode)Tj T* (WHERE A.WardNo = 3;)Tj T* T* (b\) Patients admitted between 03/03/2020 and 25/05/2020)Tj T* T* (SELECT *)Tj T* (FROM ADMITTEDPATIENT)Tj T* (WHERE EntryDate BETWEEN)Tj T* (TO_DATE\('03-03-2020','DD-MM-YYYY'\))Tj T* (AND TO_DATE\('25-05-2020','DD-MM-YYYY'\);)Tj T* T* (c\) Patients suffering from blood cancer)Tj T* T* (SELECT *)Tj T* (FROM ADMITTEDPATIENT)Tj T* (WHERE Disease = 'Blood Cancer';)Tj T* T* (d\) Create View on DOCTOR & PATIENTMASTER)Tj T* T* (CREATE VIEW Doctor_Patient_View AS)Tj T* (SELECT D.Dname, D.Qualification, P.Pname, P.age, P.bloodgroup)Tj T* (FROM DOCTOR D)Tj T* (JOIN PATIENTMASTER P ON D.Did = P.Pid;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT \(Sample\))Tj T* T* (Doctor in Ward 3:)Tj T* (Did | Dname    | DAddress | Qualification)Tj T* (1   | Dr. Amit | Mumbai   | MBBS)Tj T* T* (Patients between given dates:)Tj T* (101 | 05-MAR-20 | 15-MAR-20 | 3 | Fever)Tj T* (102 | 10-APR-20 | 20-MAY-20 | 2 | Blood Cancer)Tj T* T* (View Created Successfully.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS:)Tj T* T* (1. PRIMARY KEY uniquely identifies records.)Tj T* (2. FOREIGN KEY creates relationship between tables.)Tj T* (3. JOIN is used to combine data from multiple tables.)Tj T* (4. VIEW is virtual table created from SELECT query.)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1f6315066-469c-4656-929d-8e228a7fd192 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
