q q 1 0 0 1 78 741.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (SQL Practical 4 - Doctor & Patient Database)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 80.68976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 625.6 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Create database using following schema. Apply Integrity Constraints and)Tj T* (answer the following queries using SQL.)Tj T* T* (DOCTOR \(Did, Dname, Daddress, qualification\))Tj T* (PATIENT \(Pid, Pname, age, gender\))Tj T* T* (Integrity Constraints:)Tj T* (1. All attributes should NOT NULL.)Tj T* (2. Did should be UNIQUE.)Tj T* (3. Pid should be UNIQUE.)Tj T* (4. Gender should be 'M' or 'F'.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE TABLES)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE DOCTOR \()Tj T* (    Did NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Dname VARCHAR2\(50\) NOT NULL,)Tj T* (    Daddress VARCHAR2\(100\) NOT NULL,)Tj T* (    qualification VARCHAR2\(20\) NOT NULL)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE PATIENT \()Tj T* (    Pid NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Pname VARCHAR2\(50\) NOT NULL,)Tj T* (    age NUMBER NOT NULL,)Tj T* (    gender CHAR\(1\) CHECK \(gender IN \('M','F'\)\) NOT NULL)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT AT LEAST 10 RECORDS)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO DOCTOR VALUES \(1,'Dr. Amit','Mumbai','MBBS'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO DOCTOR VALUES \(2,'Dr. Neha','Pune','MD'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO DOCTOR VALUES \(3,'Dr. Raj','Delhi','M.S'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO DOCTOR VALUES \(4,'Dr. Simran','Nashik','MBBS'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO DOCTOR VALUES \(5,'Dr. Karan','Nagpur','M.D'\);)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO PATIENT VALUES \(1,'Rahul',25,'M'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO PATIENT VALUES \(2,'Sneha',30,'F'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO PATIENT VALUES \(3,'Aman',45,'M'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO PATIENT VALUES \(4,'Pooja',35,'F'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO PATIENT VALUES \(5,'Rohit',50,'M'\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (1 row inserted.)Tj T* (Commit complete.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: QUERIES)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (a\) Insert at least 10 records)Tj T* (   \(Done above\))Tj T* T* (b\) Find details of all doctors)Tj T* (   SELECT * FROM DOCTOR;)Tj T* T* (c\) Delete records from DOCTOR where qualification is 'M.S')Tj T* (   DELETE FROM DOCTOR WHERE qualification='M.S';)Tj T* T* (d\) Find details of patient where age < 40)Tj T* (   SELECT * FROM PATIENT WHERE age < 40;)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F132871f68-d6ab-4464-ada0-b81d776816b6 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
