q q 1 0 0 1 78 447.0898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 308.8 Tm (e\) Update patient name where patient id = 5)Tj T* (   UPDATE PATIENT SET Pname='Ramesh' WHERE Pid=5;)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT \(Sample\))Tj T* T* (SELECT * FROM DOCTOR;)Tj T* T* (Did | Dname     | Daddress | qualification)Tj T* (1   | Dr. Amit  | Mumbai   | MBBS)Tj T* (2   | Dr. Neha  | Pune     | MD)Tj T* (4   | Dr. Simran| Nashik   | MBBS)Tj T* (5   | Dr. Karan | Nagpur   | M.D)Tj T* T* (SELECT * FROM PATIENT WHERE age < 40;)Tj T* T* (Pid | Pname  | age | gender)Tj T* (1   | Rahul  | 25  | M)Tj T* (2   | Sneha  | 30  | F)Tj T* (4   | Pooja  | 35  | F)Tj T* T* (After Update:)Tj T* (SELECT * FROM PATIENT WHERE Pid=5;)Tj T* T* (5 | Ramesh | 50 | M)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS:)Tj T* T* (1. PRIMARY KEY ensures uniqueness and NOT NULL.)Tj T* (2. CHECK constraint restricts gender values.)Tj T* (3. NOT NULL prevents empty values.)Tj T* (4. DELETE removes records permanently.)Tj T* (5. UPDATE modifies existing records.)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F128289c79-75d0-471c-b032-270edb8d710a 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
