q q 1 0 0 1 78 455.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 300 Tm (-----------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: DISPLAY DATA)Tj T* (-----------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SELECT * FROM Employee;)Tj T* (SELECT * FROM Works;)Tj T* (SELECT * FROM Company;)Tj T* (SELECT * FROM Manages;)Tj T* T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (Emp_no | Employee_name | Street   | City)Tj T* (1      | Om            | MG Road  | Mumbai)Tj T* T* (WORKS)Tj T* (Emp_no | Company_name | Joining_date | Designation | Salary)Tj T* (1      | TCS          | 01-JAN-24    | Developer   | 40000)Tj T* T* (COMPANY)Tj T* (Emp_no | City)Tj T* (1      | Mumbai)Tj T* T* (MANAGES)Tj T* (Emp_no | Manager_name | Mang_no)Tj T* (1      | Amit         | 101)Tj T* T* (-----------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS)Tj T* (-----------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (1. Emp_no is Primary Key in Employee table.)Tj T* (2. Foreign Key is used to link related tables.)Tj T* (3. Joining_date datatype is DATE.)Tj T* (4. Salary datatype is NUMBER\(8,2\).)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F132a96be5-b8a2-4c32-a42d-cc9fb9a17c50 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
