q q 1 0 0 1 78 741.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 6 - Retrieve Employee Details)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 80.68976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 625.6 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a PL/SQL code to retrieve the employee name, joining date, )Tj T* (and designation from employee database of an employee whose )Tj T* (employee number is input by the user.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE TABLE \(If not already created\))Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_no NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Join_date DATE,)Tj T* (    Designation VARCHAR2\(50\))Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om',TO_DATE\('01-01-2023','DD-MM-YYYY'\),'Developer'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul',TO_DATE\('15-06-2022','DD-MM-YYYY'\),'Manager'\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(3,'Sneha',TO_DATE\('10-03-2021','DD-MM-YYYY'\),'HR'\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: PL/SQL BLOCK)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    v_empno EMPLOYEE.Emp_no%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_name EMPLOYEE.Emp_name%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_date EMPLOYEE.Join_date%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_desig EMPLOYEE.Designation%TYPE;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    v_empno := &Enter_Employee_Number;)Tj T* T* (    SELECT Emp_name, Join_date, Designation)Tj T* (    INTO v_name, v_date, v_desig)Tj T* (    FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (    WHERE Emp_no = v_empno;)Tj T* T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Employee Name: ' || v_name\);)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Joining Date: ' || v_date\);)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Designation: ' || v_desig\);)Tj T* T* (EXCEPTION)Tj T* (    WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Employee not found.'\);)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (SAMPLE INPUT:)Tj T* T* (Enter value for Enter_Employee_Number: 1)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Employee Name: Om)Tj T* (Joining Date: 01-JAN-23)Tj T* (Designation: Developer)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F197d43b30-2049-45ee-b910-d7c8126b271a 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
