q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 7 - Update Salary Using)Tj T* (Cursor)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a PL/SQL code to update the salary of employees who earn )Tj T* (less than the average salary using cursor.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om',30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul',50000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(3,'Sneha',20000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(4,'Amit',60000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(5,'Neha',25000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: PL/SQL CODE USING CURSOR)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    v_avg_salary EMPLOYEE.Salary%TYPE;)Tj T* T* (    CURSOR emp_cursor IS)Tj T* (        SELECT Emp_id, Salary)Tj T* (        FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (        WHERE Salary < \(SELECT AVG\(Salary\) FROM EMPLOYEE\);)Tj T* T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    -- Calculate average salary)Tj T* (    SELECT AVG\(Salary\) INTO v_avg_salary FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Average Salary: ' || v_avg_salary\);)Tj T* T* (    -- Loop through employees earning less than average)Tj T* (    FOR emp_rec IN emp_cursor LOOP)Tj T* (        UPDATE EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (        SET Salary = Salary + 5000)Tj T* (        WHERE Emp_id = emp_rec.Emp_id;)Tj T* T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Salary Updated for Emp_id: ' || emp_rec.Emp_id\);)Tj T* (    END LOOP;)Tj T* T* (    COMMIT;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT \(Sample\))Tj T* T* (Average Salary: 37000)Tj T* T* (Salary Updated for Emp_id: 1)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1354f9dba-12d2-485a-a32d-9d3cbd283eab 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
