q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 8 - Row Trigger on Salary)Tj T* (Table)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a row trigger to insert the existing values of the salary table )Tj T* (into a new table when the salary table is updated.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE SALARY TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE SALARY \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO SALARY VALUES \(1,'Om',30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO SALARY VALUES \(2,'Rahul',50000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO SALARY VALUES \(3,'Sneha',40000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: CREATE BACKUP TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE SALARY_BACKUP \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Old_Salary NUMBER,)Tj T* (    Updated_On DATE)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 4: CREATE ROW LEVEL TRIGGER)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER Salary_Update_Trigger)Tj T* (BEFORE UPDATE ON SALARY)Tj T* (FOR EACH ROW)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    INSERT INTO SALARY_BACKUP)Tj T* (    VALUES \(:OLD.Emp_id, :OLD.Emp_name, :OLD.Salary, SYSDATE\);)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Trigger Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 5: UPDATE SALARY TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (UPDATE SALARY)Tj T* (SET Salary = 35000)Tj T* (WHERE Emp_id = 1;)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1d582cb00-9bfd-42de-b813-e18e0dd793c9 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
