q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 9 - Trigger to Show Old and)Tj T* (New Ename)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a trigger on the Employee table which shows the old values )Tj T* (and new values of Ename after any updation on Ename on Employee table.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE EMPLOYEE TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Ename VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om',30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul',40000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: CREATE ROW LEVEL TRIGGER)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER Emp_Name_Update_Trigger)Tj T* (BEFORE UPDATE OF Ename ON EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (FOR EACH ROW)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Old Name: ' || :OLD.Ename\);)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('New Name: ' || :NEW.Ename\);)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Trigger Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 4: UPDATE EMPLOYEE NAME)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (UPDATE EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (SET Ename = 'Bhavesh')Tj T* (WHERE Emp_id = 1;)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Old Name: Om)Tj T* (New Name: Bhavesh)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS:)Tj T* T* (1. BEFORE UPDATE OF Ename trigger fires only when Ename is updated.)Tj T* (2. :OLD stores old column value.)Tj T* (3. :NEW stores new column value.)Tj T* (4. FOR EACH ROW makes it a row-level trigger.)Tj T* (5. DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE displays the result.)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F115155309-eea1-4676-935d-da0b3b6cf291 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
