q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 12 - Function for Department)Tj T* (Total Salary)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 93.88976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 590.4 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a PL/SQL function that accepts the department number and )Tj T* (returns the total salary of the department. Also, write a block to call the function.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Dept_no NUMBER,)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om',10,30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul',10,40000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(3,'Sneha',20,50000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(4,'Amit',20,35000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: CREATE FUNCTION)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION Get_Total_Salary\(p_deptno IN NUMBER\))Tj T* (RETURN NUMBER)Tj T* (IS)Tj T* (    v_total NUMBER;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    SELECT SUM\(Salary\) INTO v_total)Tj T* (    FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (    WHERE Dept_no = p_deptno;)Tj T* T* (    RETURN v_total;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Function Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 4: CALL FUNCTION USING PL/SQL BLOCK)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    v_result NUMBER;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    v_result := Get_Total_Salary\(10\);)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Total Salary of Department 10: ' || v_result\);)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Total Salary of Department 10: 70000)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 .8 Tm (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1a8141abe-d25d-41f7-922d-031534005dd5 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
