q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT -.229051 Tw 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 16 - Trigger for Auditing Table)Tj T* 0 Tw (Changes)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Create a trigger that records changes to an EMPLOYEES table )Tj T* (\(INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE\) into an EMPLOYEES_AUDIT table. )Tj T* (Include details like EMPLOYEE_ID, OPERATION_TYPE, TIMESTAMP.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE EMPLOYEES TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEES \()Tj T* (    Employee_ID NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Employee_Name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: CREATE AUDIT TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEES_AUDIT \()Tj T* (    Employee_ID NUMBER,)Tj T* (    Operation_Type VARCHAR2\(10\),)Tj T* (    Operation_Time DATE)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: CREATE TRIGGER)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER Employees_Audit_Trigger)Tj T* (AFTER INSERT OR UPDATE OR DELETE ON EMPLOYEES)Tj T* (FOR EACH ROW)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    IF INSERTING THEN)Tj T* (        INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES_AUDIT)Tj T* (        VALUES \(:NEW.Employee_ID, 'INSERT', SYSDATE\);)Tj T* T* (    ELSIF UPDATING THEN)Tj T* (        INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES_AUDIT)Tj T* (        VALUES \(:NEW.Employee_ID, 'UPDATE', SYSDATE\);)Tj T* T* (    ELSIF DELETING THEN)Tj T* (        INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES_AUDIT)Tj T* (        VALUES \(:OLD.Employee_ID, 'DELETE', SYSDATE\);)Tj T* (    END IF;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Trigger Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 4: TEST THE TRIGGER)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES VALUES \(1,'Om',30000\);)Tj T* (UPDATE EMPLOYEES SET Salary = 35000 WHERE Employee_ID = 1;)Tj T* (DELETE FROM EMPLOYEES WHERE Employee_ID = 1;)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1772b3590-db09-4f83-8865-7a3117086107 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
