q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 17 - Employee Bonus Using)Tj T* (Explicit Cursor)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 93.88976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 590.4 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a PL/SQL program using an explicit cursor to calculate and )Tj T* (display a 10% bonus for all employees whose salary is greater than 50,000. )Tj T* (Assume a table EMPLOYEES with columns EMPLOYEE_ID, NAME, and SALARY.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE EMPLOYEES TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEES \()Tj T* (    EMPLOYEE_ID NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    NAME VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    SALARY NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES VALUES \(1,'Om',60000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES VALUES \(2,'Rahul',45000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES VALUES \(3,'Sneha',75000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEES VALUES \(4,'Amit',52000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: PL/SQL PROGRAM USING EXPLICIT CURSOR)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    CURSOR emp_cursor IS)Tj T* (        SELECT EMPLOYEE_ID, NAME, SALARY)Tj T* (        FROM EMPLOYEES)Tj T* (        WHERE SALARY > 50000;)Tj T* T* (    v_id EMPLOYEES.EMPLOYEE_ID%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_name EMPLOYEES.NAME%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_salary EMPLOYEES.SALARY%TYPE;)Tj T* (    v_bonus NUMBER;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    OPEN emp_cursor;)Tj T* T* (    LOOP)Tj T* (        FETCH emp_cursor INTO v_id, v_name, v_salary;)Tj T* (        EXIT WHEN emp_cursor%NOTFOUND;)Tj T* T* (        v_bonus := v_salary * 0.10;)Tj T* T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Employee ID: ' || v_id\);)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Name: ' || v_name\);)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Salary: ' || v_salary\);)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Bonus \(10%\): ' || v_bonus\);)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('-----------------------------'\);)Tj T* (    END LOOP;)Tj T* T* (    CLOSE emp_cursor;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 .8 Tm (Employee ID: 1)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F150413b66-2d57-4f09-8cc5-d5c02e054f78 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
