q q 1 0 0 1 78 719.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm (SQL Practical No. 18 - Implementation of)Tj T* (Aggregate Functions)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 85.08976 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 599.2 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write a SQL program to implement Aggregate Functions.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: CREATE EMPLOYEE TABLE)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (CREATE TABLE EMPLOYEE \()Tj T* (    Emp_id NUMBER PRIMARY KEY,)Tj T* (    Emp_name VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Department VARCHAR2\(50\),)Tj T* (    Salary NUMBER)Tj T* (\);)Tj T* T* (OUTPUT:)Tj T* (Table Created.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 2: INSERT SAMPLE DATA)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(1,'Om','IT',50000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(2,'Rahul','HR',30000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(3,'Sneha','IT',60000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(4,'Amit','Finance',40000\);)Tj T* (INSERT INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES \(5,'Neha','HR',35000\);)Tj T* T* (COMMIT;)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 3: APPLY AGGREGATE FUNCTIONS)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <312920434f554e542829209620436f756e7420746f74616c20656d706c6f79656573>Tj T* T* (SELECT COUNT\(*\) AS Total_Employees FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* (Total_Employees)Tj T* (5)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <32292053554d2829209620546f74616c2073616c617279206f6620656d706c6f79656573>Tj T* T* (SELECT SUM\(Salary\) AS Total_Salary FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* (Total_Salary)Tj T* (215000)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <3329204156472829209620417665726167652073616c617279>Tj T* T* (SELECT AVG\(Salary\) AS Average_Salary FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* (Average_Salary)Tj T* (43000)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <3429204d41582829209620486967686573742073616c617279>Tj T* T* (SELECT MAX\(Salary\) AS Highest_Salary FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1bef0bde5-2d11-4647-a38b-d59289117ed7 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
