q q 1 0 0 1 78 447.0898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 308.8 Tm (Highest_Salary)Tj T* (60000)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <3529204d494e28292096204c6f776573742073616c617279>Tj T* T* (SELECT MIN\(Salary\) AS Lowest_Salary FROM EMPLOYEE;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* (Lowest_Salary)Tj T* (30000)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* <36292041676772656761746520776974682047524f55502042592096204465706172746d656e742d7769736520746f74616c2073616c617279>Tj T* T* (SELECT Department, SUM\(Salary\) AS Total_Salary)Tj T* (FROM EMPLOYEE)Tj T* (GROUP BY Department;)Tj T* T* (Expected Output:)Tj T* T* (Department | Total_Salary)Tj T* (IT         | 110000)Tj T* (HR         | 65000)Tj T* (Finance    | 40000)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS:)Tj T* T* (1. Aggregate functions operate on multiple rows and return a single value.)Tj T* (2. Common aggregate functions: COUNT, SUM, AVG, MAX, MIN.)Tj T* (3. GROUP BY is used with aggregate functions.)Tj T* (4. NULL values are ignored in aggregate functions \(except COUNT\(*\)\).)Tj T* (5. Aggregate functions are used in SELECT statement.)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F1cc231e1b-85cf-4915-8947-342a62e42cf0 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
