q q 1 0 0 1 78 741.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (PL/SQL Practical No. 19 - Finding Even Numbers)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 78 168.6898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 8.8 TL/F3 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 36 537.6 Tm (QUESTION:)Tj T* T* (Write PL/SQL code for finding even numbers.)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (STEP 1: PL/SQL BLOCK TO DISPLAY EVEN NUMBERS FROM 1 TO 20)Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (SET SERVEROUTPUT ON;)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    i NUMBER;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Even Numbers from 1 to 20 are:'\);)Tj T* T* (    FOR i IN 1..20 LOOP)Tj T* (        IF MOD\(i, 2\) = 0 THEN)Tj T* (            DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\(i\);)Tj T* (        END IF;)Tj T* (    END LOOP;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (EXPECTED OUTPUT:)Tj T* T* (Even Numbers from 1 to 20 are:)Tj T* (2)Tj T* (4)Tj T* (6)Tj T* (8)Tj T* (10)Tj T* (12)Tj T* (14)Tj T* (16)Tj T* (18)Tj T* (20)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (ALTERNATIVE METHOD \(Using WHILE Loop\))Tj T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* T* (DECLARE)Tj T* (    i NUMBER := 2;)Tj T* (BEGIN)Tj T* (    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\('Even Numbers from 1 to 20 are:'\);)Tj T* T* (    WHILE i <= 20 LOOP)Tj T* (        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE\(i\);)Tj T* (        i := i + 2;)Tj T* (    END LOOP;)Tj T* (END;)Tj T* (/)Tj T* T* (------------------------------------------------------------)Tj T* (VIVA POINTS:)Tj T* T* (1. MOD\(number, 2\) = 0 checks even number.)Tj T* (2. FOR loop runs from starting to ending value.)Tj T* (3. WHILE loop runs until condition becomes false.)Tj T* (4. DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE displays output.)Tj T* (5. SET SERVEROUTPUT ON enables output display.)Tj T* ET Q Q q 0 0 612 792 re W n BT 9.6 TL/F13a590c9e-ba55-4802-8494-cec909d94047 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 511.352 777.6 Tm T* ET Q
endstream
endobj
